\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 23.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;☞ 시간외 및 공휴일에 실습한 경우 그 일수를 총 실습 일수에 가산 할 수 있음</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(8시간 1일, 주 5일 근무시 1주 산정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 신청방법 : </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">원스톱서비스 접속/ 로그인 / 학사관리 / 산업체현장실습메뉴 활용</span></p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/onestop.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">onestop.html</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">)</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 신청기한 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 2011. 08. 10(수) ~ 08. 22(월)까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. 대상 업체(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">실습업체가 사전에 지정된 경우에 한함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">온라인으로 신청하되, 대상업체가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">원스톱 목록에 없는 경우는 첨부2.(업체현황양식)를 별도로 작성한 후 그린에너지센터행정실로 제출(메일, 팩스 가능)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 업체가 목록에 있어도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">반드시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 센터로 연락하여 알려주어야 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -44.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -126.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 126.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">6. 제출서류(반드시 실습완료 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5일 이내로 입력 및 제출 완료하여야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -126.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 126.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #009900; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">실습일지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 학생 원스톰에서 입력(출력 無)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -126.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 126.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #009900; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">결과보고서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 학생 원스톱에서 입력(출력 無)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -126.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 126.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #009900; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">설문지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 작성하여 센터로 직접 제출(첨부3)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -136.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 136.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #009900; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">업체평가서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> : 산업체에서 원본을 받아서 센터로 직접 제출(첨부2)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -136.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 136.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">7. 성적평가 : 학부(과)장은 실습업체 평가내용과 실습일지 및 지도교수의 종합평가 결과보고서에 의하여 성적을 평가함</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -92.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 92.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -92.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 92.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">8. 수강신청 : 학기 개시 전 수강신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(교무연구과에서 일괄신청 예정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: -167.7pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 167.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">9. 성적처리 : 평가한 성적은 2011학년도 2학기 성적으로 등재 처리.(S or U)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -19.7pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">10. 실습지원비 지원 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -19.7pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-